Although the OLS model and the regularized models selected by **\(\lambda_{min}\)** achieve slightly lower cross-validation errors, the differences are very small. The lowest cross-validation RMSE is obtained by **Lasso (\(\lambda_{min}\))** (0.7544), followed closely by **OLS** (0.7546) and **Ridge (\(\lambda_{min}\))** (0.7597). These differences are negligible relative to the overall prediction error.

